## Result / rollback
Target-family diagnostic profile (64 completed target calls/arm) rejects the
candidate: 3.30810 ms vs control 2.25125 ms, **+46.95% slower**. Non-profile
smoke agrees (2275.93 vs 2457.93 tok/s, −7.40%). The profile harness aborts
only after 400 calls in *both* arms; it is documented as inherited and not used
as full-wall evidence. The guarded source is reverted; no candidate binaries,
weights, or build directories are committed.
